    "idealSummary": "Not every bad headline matters to your investment. A lawsuit whose worst case is under 0.1% of revenue, with no effect on clients and unchanged guidance, is - in plain financial terms - immaterial, however serious the headline sounds. Trading on the tone of a headline instead of its actual, measured impact is exactly how beginners turn harmless noise into needless buying and selling."
